abstract: >-
  IBDock Provenire is a reproducibility-oriented AutoDock Vina workflow
  that records search-space provenance as persistent project state and
  makes atom correspondence explicit during reference-based pose
  validation. Search spaces can be derived from automatically or manually
  selected co-crystallized ligands, P2Rank, fpocket, or the receptor
  envelope, and every generated grid is stored together with the method
  and ligand instances that produced it. Pose validation combines
  symmetry-aware graph correspondence (sPyRMSD) with a provenance-aware
  coordinate bridge, and cases for which no complete correspondence can
  be established are retained as unresolved rather than assigned
  approximate mappings.
